2096..2173 Comment "/// Winding a composite is summing the windings (cubical\'s `winding-hom`), by"
2174..2248 Comment "/// induction on the first loop, written last so its match stands directly"
2249..2327 Comment "/// under the recursion, where the checkers read it as a fold, and summed with"
2328..2392 Comment "/// `wind(q)` first because the sum descends its second summand:"
2393..2468 Comment "/// `here(wind(q))` on the empty word, and the recursive call carried along"
2469..2542 Comment "/// `up` or `down`. The composite in its type is read off the parameters\'"
2543..2602 Comment "/// written types (#423), and the kernel reads its endpoint"
2603..2662 Comment "/// `plus(wind(q), wind(p))` as the call it returns (#424)."
